      "Explore the protective factors identified in the 'hidden_insight' (Adaptability, Work-Life Balance, Problem Solving) and consider how to foster these attributes across the workforce to potentially reduce overall attrition.",
      "Re-evaluate and potentially enhance the features used in the attrition model, incorporating more robust behavioral, attitudinal, or external market data to improve predictive accuracy beyond the current baseline.",
